<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.kathoc.ReplayArcade</id>
  <name>ReplayArcade</name>
  <summary>Record, rewind and replay arcade play with frame-exact timelines</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-2.0-or-later AND LicenseRef-FBNeo</project_license>
  <description>
    <p>ReplayArcade is ReplayNES with an arcade core (FinalBurn Neo): input-history recording,
    rewind and retry, practice sections, video export, per-game button assignment and turbo for pads
    and arcade sticks. No ROMs are included.</p>
  </description>
